THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository. They do not
cover third-party datasets, which are not redistributed here, nor the small
set of evidence figures under artifacts/ that are derived from them.

  Fan et al. stereo pothole dataset — MIT.
  https://github.com/ruirangerfan/stereo_pothole_datasets
  Source of artifacts/a3-grid/.../failures/*.jpg.

  Pothole video dataset for semantic segmentation, Mendeley Data 5bwfg4v4cd —
  CC BY 4.0. https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/5bwfg4v4cd/2

  4Seasons, copyright Artisense — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, non-commercial, and
  registration is required before download.
  https://cvg.cit.tum.de/data/datasets/4seasons-dataset
  Source of artifacts/vo-drift-final/office_loop_1.png, a trajectory plot.
  Reuse of that figure is subject to the 4Seasons terms, not to MIT.

  Pothole-600 — research use.
  https://sites.google.com/view/pothole-600/dataset

Model weights in models/ and artifacts/ are trained on Pothole-600 and
PothRGBD; downstream use should respect those datasets' terms.

Demo videos are published separately under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 at
https://huggingface.co/datasets/khoa-na/pothole-gps-localization-demos
